DairyFarm public demo schedule
==============================

Agreed schedule: run daily, including weekends, using America/Los_Angeles
local time (Pacific time, with daylight-saving changes):

  4:30 a.m.  Cloud Scheduler sets the Cloud SQL instance to ALWAYS.
             This provides startup time before the demo's 5:00 a.m. opening.
  6:00 p.m.  Cloud Scheduler sets the Cloud SQL instance to NEVER.

This schedule controls Cloud SQL only. Cloud Run services are configured to
scale to zero when idle. Supporting resources such as Artifact Registry,
Secret Manager, and Cloud Scheduler remain provisioned and may still incur
charges.

The live schedules are defined in terraform/gcp/scheduling.tf. To inspect
their current configuration:

  cd terraform/gcp
  ./verify-schedule-gcp.sh --check
